    Bug 2045208 - Test that the Organization header is set implicitly by the backend. r=mkmelin

    messages.sendMessage() and messages.saveMessage() never set the Organization
    header, yet it appears in the created messages. nsIMsgCompose.sendMsg() copies it
    from the sending identity (nsMsgCompose::SendMsg), so the message carries the
    identity's organization without the API doing anything. A *different* value set on
    compFields would not survive either, since SendMsg overwrites it from the identity
    unconditionally.

    This adds test coverage for that implicit behavior: the test identity is configured
    with an organization, and verifyMessage() asserts every sent and saved message
    includes the matching Organization header.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304950

